  characterName: Bartolina Quispe
  promptText: A consortium links infrastructure pledges to lithium extraction near
    sacred springs. Proponents promise schools and jobs; independent notes warn of
    aquifer drawdown and chemical risk. The trade-off is immediate investment versus
    long-term water security.
  leftAnswer: Investment can deliver schools and jobs your community needs now.
  rightAnswer: Losing the springs would erase the foundation no funding can replace.
